9
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Starve Acre is a 2023 British folk horror film written and directed by Daniel
Kokotajlo, based upon the 2019 novel of the same name by Andrew Michael Hurley.

10
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The film stars Matt Smith and Morfydd Clark.

11
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Starve Acre had its world premiere at the BFI London Film Festival on 12 October
2023, and was released in the United Kingdom on 6 September 2024.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The film explores themes of small town, based on novel or
book, 1970s, archaeologist, folk horror.

13
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
The tone is dark and thought_provoking and emotional.
